28561 strategies p, each against the 16 deterministic deviators plus itself = 485537 ordered pairs
   swept in 10.4 s
Akin's residual  sum_X d_X (p~_X - 1{X in CC,CD})  is exactly the zero polynomial: True
the four limits sum to exactly 1 in every pair: True

leading eps-exponent m_X of the state occupancies w_X(eps) = d_X/Dtot, over all 1827904
(pair, state) combinations -- m_X = 0 means the state keeps positive mass in the limit:
   eps^0                  1353556
   eps^1                   457548
   eps^2                    16800

self-play symmetry W_CD(p,p) = W_DC(p,p) (relabelling the focal player is the state
swap CD <-> DC and self-play is invariant under it): True, exactly, at all 28561 strategies

