2.  FINITE-eps CROSS-CHECK, eps = 10^-4, 10^-6, 10^-8, exact Fractions
==============================================================================
subgrid: 0, 1/4, 1/3, 1/2, 2/3, 3/4, 1  ->  2401 strategies x 16 deviators x 3 eps = 115248 exact 4x4 solves
   Gaussian elimination reproduces d_X(eps)/Dtot(eps) exactly, all 4 states, all 3 eps:  38416 / 38416 pairs
   Akin's residual exactly 0 in Fractions at all 3 eps:                                 38416 / 38416 pairs
   |w_CC/(lc eps^m) - 1| -> 0 monotonically, a threshold-free confirmation of the
   exponent m and the coefficient lc:                                          38416 / 38416 pairs
   of those, 375 pairs have w_CC(eps) EXACTLY lc eps^m at every eps (the correction
   vanishes identically, so there is nothing left to converge)
   (6.6 s)

